{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　こんばちは\nジェットコースターに乗ると自然と笑ってしまうのって私だけですか？叫ぼう！って思わないときゃーって言えなくて何も考えてないと笑いが込み上げてくるタイプです。\n一番笑ってしまうのは今のところフライングダイナソー🦕\n佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせです💎本日21時から日本テレビ「深イイ話」に出演させていただきます！ぜひご覧ください〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「FNS歌謡祭」の歌収録でユニバーサルスタジオジャパンにお邪魔した時少しだけ遊ぶ時間があったので二手に分かれて遊ばせていただきました🧚‍♀️\nお天気も良くて幸せすぎました〜本当に楽しい時間でした🥰"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVAVP9970YA6KF3E5ZRY1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVBXE0KF1XNFZT43FYG10","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVCXWCKD0EDVSM0YM0E7X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVDYPTCF3RMHBNW5RV3Y0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVF002CNV57VJZZMAAZXC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVG37MJ4979ESCWSTZZRX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVH87WY2ZFC6F31Q10N4F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVJCRFMVTMSVPJAW34FRJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVKFG8SE7VS4FTWZZ6ZWS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nはっぴーすぎてみんな弾けてたよ🦁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVMJ85XPGPEVT0NPD49BQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVNNXRZW4W04V2XKMAM1Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VVPRZ4Z8A46N7HXRE1ND6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text